(7743845, 1277812, 83313, '<td valign="top">Such majestic animals. I got a chance to ride my bike among them at Caprock Canyons recently. Had to wait several times for them to wander away from the road before I could continue my ride.</td>', 'Such majestic animals. I got a chance to ride my bike among them at Caprock Canyons recently. Had to wait several times for them to wander away from the road before I could continue my ride.', '2023-05-06 17:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7743846, 1277697, 83313, '<td valign="top">Turned out quite nicely. Their coloring makes it look like they don''t have eyes. I''d be interested in knowing the evolutionary purpose of that feature. Won''t vote on this one since I was with you when you shot this.</td>', 'Turned out quite nicely. Their coloring makes it look like they don''t have eyes. I''d be interested in knowing the evolutionary purpose of that feature. Won''t vote on this one since I was with you when you shot this.', '2023-05-06 17:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7743847, 1277631, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the translucent glow coming from the  overhead light. Overall, the scene seems a bit soft, however, and my eye is trying to find more detail than there is.</td>', 'I like the translucent glow coming from the  overhead light. Overall, the scene seems a bit soft, however, and my eye is trying to find more detail than there is.', '2023-05-06 17:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
