(7743868, 1277769, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a true assortment of ''things'', albeit still all semi-related, but one of the better images in this challenge.  Well seen and captured.</td>', 'This is a true assortment of ''things'', albeit still all semi-related, but one of the better images in this challenge.  Well seen and captured.', '2023-05-07 11:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7743869, 1277750, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting, although I personally don''t care for the left rotation. Very colorful.</td>', 'Interesting, although I personally don''t care for the left rotation. Very colorful.', '2023-05-07 11:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7743870, 1277760, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well, they are kind of all the same thing, but a nice group of cattle nonetheless.  Too heavy on the noise reduction IMO (I like detail), but I''m sure the general voting group here will enjoy it.</td>', 'Well, they are kind of all the same thing, but a nice group of cattle nonetheless.  Too heavy on the noise reduction IMO (I like detail), but I''m sure the general voting group here will enjoy it.', '2023-05-07 11:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7743871, 1277697, 30049, '<td valign="top">Gulliver makes this a ''group'' of things.  :-)  Otherwise it''s a flock of one bird type.  Sorry, been seeing too many groups of all one thing so far in my viewing / voting.  This is a lovely image.  Good luck.</td>', 'Gulliver makes this a ''group'' of things.  :-)  Otherwise it''s a flock of one bird type.  Sorry, been seeing too many groups of all one thing so far in my viewing / voting.  This is a lovely image.  Good luck.', '2023-05-07 11:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7743872, 1277809, 30049, '<td valign="top">''Things''?  It a wooded lot or forest of trees.  :-)  I do like the toning choice.</td>', '''Things''?  It a wooded lot or forest of trees.  :-)  I do like the toning choice.', '2023-05-07 11:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7743873, 1277797, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a little guy!  To fit on a marigold like that is pretty cool.  A bit thin on the number of ''things'', but you do have more than one type so kudos to you on that.  The photo itself is wonderful.</td>', 'That''s a little guy!  To fit on a marigold like that is pretty cool.  A bit thin on the number of ''things'', but you do have more than one type so kudos to you on that.  The photo itself is wonderful.', '2023-05-07 11:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7743874, 1277713, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like the vehicle track thru the middle of this.  That''s a gallery worthy find and capture in itself.  The play of lines intersecting and the trees blocking you from advancing the viewers roaming is a lovely play.  There are certainly several ''things'' in this capture.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I really like the vehicle track thru the middle of this.  That''s a gallery worthy find and capture in itself.  The play of lines intersecting and the trees blocking you from advancing the viewers roaming is a lovely play.  There are certainly several ''things'' in this capture.  Nicely done!', '2023-05-07 11:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7743875, 1277806, 30049, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but somewhat ho-hummish, static as subject material.  Maybe what is making me feel that way is the background choice; it blends with the DPC voting page background.  If your background was white it may have jumped out more?  Sorry.  Just thinking out loud here.  Good luck.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but somewhat ho-hummish, static as subject material.  Maybe what is making me feel that way is the background choice; it blends with the DPC voting page background.  If your background was white it may have jumped out more?  Sorry.  Just thinking out loud here.  Good luck.', '2023-05-07 11:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7743876, 1277799, 30049, '<td valign="top">The group of ''things'' is one subject class (vehicles), but I do like the view and your title works very well with the arrows on the pavement.  :-)</td>', 'The group of ''things'' is one subject class (vehicles), but I do like the view and your title works very well with the arrows on the pavement.  :-)', '2023-05-07 11:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
